ecks for the band. He was good at that. He took care of the business end of it, and I took care of the music part of it. Nick DiMaio was very good. He was not only a good player, but he was good with the band too. I told him - I said, \"We've got 17 or 18 good musicians here, so I want to give them a good opportunity. \" ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11429$40675C55-D632-4DC3-93F6-C9C1B82B9F20", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "b376b6db44e396f144e539b60d7c6302848e5e26", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/633.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11429$8321D591-4E75-4F24-909C-98BBBCD5C638", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "37c56fb9c2fa46e9304203ae27aa453b24e62ce6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 134, "id": "Q134"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11429$79B6E8B6-1B72-488D-B1AB-AB40E5EA02ED", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "d6f112ba89ed8b44b94885126c5c5c4914902d89", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1290, "id": "Q1290"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11429$D1501B21-0BD3-4B29-8F30-7FE5BAD28494", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11429$1555CBA0-B0CF-430E-AB99-58CE7AC88A6C", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "6728b1d69fb03de3e91c83a040b2b8876a0c8810", "datavalue": {"value": {"enti